{"id": "EUVD-2021-34899", "enisaUuid": "79634053-8f52-33e8-be48-d96efea2971b", "description": "DedeCMS through 5.8.1-beta contains a PHP code injection vulnerability in ShowMsg() where the HTTP Referer header is written into a DedeTemplate string and included. Unauthenticated attackers can send a crafted Referer to /plus/flink.php?dopost=save with an empty validate code to execute arbitrary PHP and system commands. Exploitation evidence was first observed by the Shadowserver Foundation on 2023-10-14.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:31", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://srcincite.io/blog/2021/09/30/chasing-a-dream-pwning-the-biggest-cms-in-china.html", "https://github.com/dedecms/DedeCMS/blob/v5.8.1/include/common.func.php", "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/dedecms/dedecms-rce.yaml", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/dedecms-5.8.1-beta-unauthenticated-rce-via-plus-flink-php"], "aliases": ["CVE-2021-48016", "GHSA-8g3p-p68p-pg53"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ab2c577c-f99b-3d78-a393-aa0821eda76d", "product": {"name": "DeDeCMS", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22645.8.1-beta"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5580a22b-4da7-384f-9d4b-8e45bb41bef5", "vendor": {"name": "DedeCMS"}}], "isExploited": false}